{
    "name": "postgres",
    "display_name": "PostgreSQL",
    "description": "PostgreSQL 是功能强大的开源关系型数据库，新版性能更强、特性更丰富，是 MoviePilot 等影视自动化工具的推荐数据库后端，也可作为各类自托管应用的通用数据库。",
    "category": "tool",
    "tags": ["数据库", "PostgreSQL", "MoviePilot", "基础服务", "开源"],
    "website": "https://www.postgresql.org/",
    "source_url": "https://github.com/postgres/postgres",
    "architectures": ["amd64", "arm64"],
    "image": "postgres:17-alpine",
    "default_ports": [
        {"port": 5432, "protocol": "tcp", "description": "数据库服务端口"}
    ],
    "config_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["ports", "volumes", "postgres_env"],
        "containers": [
            {
                "name": "postgres",
                "title": "PostgreSQL",
                "settings": [
                    {"type": "ports", "title": "端口设置", "fields": ["ports"]},
                    {"type": "volumes", "title": "存储空间设置", "fields": ["volumes"]},
                    {"type": "env", "title": "环境变量", "fields": ["postgres_env"]},
                    {"type": "advanced", "title": "高级设置", "fields": ["privileged"]}
                ],
                "description": "PostgreSQL 关系型数据库"
            }
        ],
        "properties": {
            "ports": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": ["local_port", "container_port", "protocol"],
                    "properties": {
                        "protocol": {"enum": ["tcp", "udp"], "type": "string", "title": "协议", "default": "tcp"},
                        "local_port": {"type": "integer", "title": "本地端口", "maximum": 65535, "minimum": 1},
                        "container_port": {"type": "integer", "title": "容器端口", "maximum": 65535, "minimum": 1}
                    }
                },
                "title": "端口设置",
                "default": [
                    {"protocol": "tcp", "local_port": 5432, "container_port": 5432}
                ]
            },
            "volumes": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": ["host_path", "container_path", "mode"],
                    "properties": {
                        "mode": {"enum": ["rw", "ro"], "type": "string", "title": "权限", "default": "rw"},
                        "host_path": {"type": "string", "title": "本地路径", "format": "directory"},
                        "container_path": {"type": "string", "title": "容器路径"}
                    }
                },
                "title": "存储空间设置",
                "default": [
                    {"mode": "rw", "host_path": "postgres/data", "container_path": "/var/lib/postgresql/data"}
                ]
            },
            "postgres_env": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": ["key", "value"],
                    "properties": {
                        "key": {"type": "string", "title": "变量名"},
                        "value": {"type": "string", "title": "值"}
                    }
                },
                "title": "环境变量",
                "default": [
                    {"key": "POSTGRES_USER", "value": "nasdeck"},
                    {"key": "POSTGRES_PASSWORD", "value": "nasdeck"},
                    {"key": "POSTGRES_DB", "value": "nasdeck"},
                    {"key": "TZ", "value": "Asia/Shanghai"}
                ]
            },
            "privileged": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "title": "特权模式",
                "default": false,
                "description": "一般无需开启"
            }
        }
    },
    "yaml_template": "services:\n  postgres:\n    image: {{ image }}\n    container_name: {{ project_name }}\n    ports:\n{%- for port in ports %}\n      - \"{{ port.local_port }}:{{ port.container_port }}/{{ port.protocol }}\"\n{%- endfor %}\n    volumes:\n{%- for vol in volumes %}\n      - {{ to_host_path(vol.host_path if (vol.host_path.startswith('/') or vol.shared) else project_name ~ '/' ~ vol.host_path) }}:{{ vol.container_path }}:{{ vol.mode }}\n{%- endfor %}\n    privileged: {{ privileged | lower }}\n    restart: unless-stopped\n{%- if postgres_env %}\n    environment:\n{%- for item in postgres_env %}\n      - {{ item.key }}={{ item.value }}\n{%- endfor %}\n{%- endif %}\n",
    "readme": "# PostgreSQL\n\nPostgreSQL 是功能强大的开源关系型数据库，本应用使用官方 `postgres:17-alpine` 镜像，体积小巧，可作为 MoviePilot 等影视自动化工具的数据库后端。\n\n## 部署前准备\n\n1. 在「环境变量」中设置数据库账号：`POSTGRES_USER`、`POSTGRES_PASSWORD`、`POSTGRES_DB`，默认值均为 `nasdeck`，**生产环境请务必修改密码**。\n2. 数据持久化目录为 `/var/lib/postgresql/data`，请确认本地映射路径有足够磁盘空间。\n3. 首次启动时会自动按上述环境变量初始化数据库；初始化完成后再修改这些变量不会生效，需清空数据目录重建。\n\n## 使用\n\n- 连接地址：`<NAS-IP>:5432`，在 MoviePilot 等应用的数据库配置中填写主机、端口、用户名、密码和数据库名即可。\n- 仅在内网使用时建议不要将 5432 端口暴露到公网。",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "type": "compose",
    "changelog": "初始导入",
    "backup_paths": ["/var/lib/postgresql/data"],
    "is_builtin": false
}
